ere totally unexpected."},{"key":"D","text":"It was total unexpected."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"was totally unexpected。","verify":"\"It was totally unexpected.\""},{"id":"cne_j234_q3","topicId":"cne_j234","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"By the time I reached the airport, the plane had taken off. 飞机何时起飞？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"在我到达之后"},{"key":"B","text":"在我到达机场之前"},{"key":"C","text":"和我同时"},{"key":"D","text":"第二天"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"had taken off 早于 reached。","verify":"\"在我到达机场之前\""},{"id":"cne_j234_q4","topicId":"cne_j234","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"背包忘在家里了，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I have left my backpack at home before I noticed yesterday."},{"key":"B","text":"I had leave my backpack at home."},{"key":"C","text":"I had left my backpack at home."},{"key":"D","text":"I left my backpack at home after I found it missing first."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"had left 表示发现之前已经忘了。","verify":"\"I had left my backpack at home.\""},{"id":"cne_j235_q1","topicId":"cne_j235","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"By the time Carl woke up, the bus had already left. He had forgotten to set the alarm. 哪件事更早？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"他忘记设闹钟，公共汽车也先离开了"},{"key":"B","text":"他先醒来然后车才离开"},{"key":"C","text":"车还在等他"},{"key":"D","text":"闹钟先响了"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"had forgotten，had already left，然后才 woke up。","verify":"\"他忘记设闹钟，公共汽车也先离开了\""},{"id":"cne_j235_q2","topicId":"cne_j235","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"By the time Carl woke up, the bus had already left. 他醒来时车还在吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"还在门口"},{"key":"B","text":"已经离开了"},{"key":"C","text":"还没来"},{"key":"D","text":"短文没说"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"had already left。","verify":"\"已经离开了\""},{"id":"cne_j235_q3","topicId":"cne_j235","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"When Nina got home, she found the kitchen had burned. The fire was unexpected. 她到家时发现什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"厨房正在新建"},{"ke